<!--
  This is a template, not the live banner. It is tracked in git.

  To activate a banner: copy this file to banner.md in this same
  directory, then edit it. banner.md is gitignored -- it is never
  committed, edited directly on the host, and picked up on the very
  next page load. No restart or deploy needed.

  To remove the banner: delete banner.md, or empty it out.

  Both Markdown and raw HTML are supported. Links do NOT need an
  explicit target attribute -- every link is automatically forced to
  target="_blank" rel="noopener" so it opens in a new tab instead of
  navigating inside the banner's iframe.
-->

**Heads up:** this is example banner content. Replace it with a real
announcement, or delete this file (it won't do anything as
`banner.md.example` -- only `banner.md` is live).

You can use _Markdown_ formatting, and raw `<strong>HTML</strong>` too.
A [link works like this](https://example.com/) and will always open in
a new tab.
